        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>AHI Stainless Steel Dummy Leverset</b>\r\n<p>\r\nDummy Leversets are rigid and for looks only. They are Non-Locking and Non-Latching. They are used as a pull or to match trim.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN-943S-specifications.gif?v=1704354498\" width=\"231\" height=\"358\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Trim Plate size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Function: Double Dummy</li>\r\n\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\", optional up to 3-1/2\" thick door</li>\r\n\r\n\r\n<li>Trim Plate Height: 9.68\" (246 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Trim Plate Width: 1.89\" (48 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Trim Plate Thickness: 0.275\" (7 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Solid Stainless Steel Trim</li>\r\n<li>Door Levers: <a href=\"/products/jordan-leverset-with-square-rose-ahi-sig123-204\"><b>AHI SIG123 Levers</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: Matching <a href=\"/products/stainless-steel-mortise-lock-entry-leverset-ahi-sig123am48-243\"><b>Entry Leveset</b></a> \r\n</p>",
